window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-093-39c7d041efeb2cc8.json"]={sha256:"39c7d041efeb2cc8108f9845b9d2054b714fe0753a5dfea9e87703e5b83196ff",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-5d487fe40fc84b48","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/addressing-cascading-failures/","title":"Google SRE Book: addressing cascading failures","titleEn":"Google SRE Book: addressing cascading failures","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-093","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-093","related":[{"id":"security-v27-094","referenceUrls":["https://sre.google/sre-book/managing-incidents/"],"title":"Google SRE事件指揮：角色分工與交接阻塞的關鍵路徑","titleEn":"Google SRE incident command: role separation and handoff critical paths","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dependency-logic.json、truth-table.csv、minimal-cuts.json與shared-risk.md；每個元件保留服務條件而非模糊的綠色圖示。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dependency-logic.json, truth-table.csv, minimal-cuts.json and shared-risk.md. Define each component service condition explicitly rather than relying on an unexplained green status icon.","difference":"為指揮、技術處置及溝通定義交付物和接收角色，畫出任務依賴；比較單人串列與有指定接手者的平行流程。","differenceEn":"Define deliverables and receiving roles for command, technical operations and communications. Model dependencies and compare one-person serial execution with parallel work supported by explicit delegated ownership.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE討論共同相依與連鎖失效；本課只做邏輯失效枚舉，不假設故障互相獨立，也不把情境通過比例當成實際SLA。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 D代表共用解析、Z1與Z2代表兩區；三個單點故障情境分別只關閉D、Z1、Z2，其餘皆正常。 失D即失效，單失Z1或Z2仍可用，通過2/3=66.666667%；最小割集為{D}與{Z1,Z2}。","SRE事件管理使用清楚角色與共享事件狀態；本課平行性只在工作互不依賴且人員確實可用時成立，不把分工當成免費加速。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 分流4分鐘後，技術修復12分鐘與對外摘要7分鐘可平行；服務驗證5分鐘必須在修復後，最終交接需摘要與驗證都完成。 平行流程驗證完成4+12+5=21分鐘，摘要11分鐘完成；單人先摘要再修復再驗證共4+7+12+5=28。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE discusses shared dependencies and cascading failure. This exercise enumerates logical failure scenarios without assuming independent probabilities or interpreting the fraction of passing scenarios as a real service-level guarantee. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. D is the shared resolver and Z1/Z2 are regions. Three single-failure scenarios independently disable D, Z1 or Z2 while all other components remain available. D failure disables the service, while either individual region failure is tolerated, passing 2/3=66.666667%. Minimal cut sets are {D} and {Z1,Z2}.","SRE incident management uses clear roles and shared incident state. Parallelism here is valid only where tasks are independent and assigned people are actually available; delegation is not assumed to provide free acceleration. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. After four minutes of triage, remediation takes twelve and the communication summary seven, independently. Service verification takes five after remediation; final handoff requires both summary and verification to finish. The parallel workflow verifies service at 4+12+5=21 minutes, with summary ready at eleven. One person completing summary, remediation and verification serially takes 4+7+12+5=28 minutes.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-003","referenceUrls":["https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/x509-svid/"],"title":"X509-SVID：單一 URI 身分與換證重疊","titleEn":"X509-SVID: single-URI identity and renewal overlap","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付dependency-logic.json、truth-table.csv、minimal-cuts.json與shared-risk.md；每個元件保留服務條件而非模糊的綠色圖示。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver dependency-logic.json, truth-table.csv, minimal-cuts.json and shared-risk.md. Define each component service condition explicitly rather than relying on an unexplained green status icon.","difference":"製作正常葉憑證、雙URI SAN、CA旗標開啟及錯信任域四份描述檔；不產生真實密鑰。畫出舊憑證到期、新憑證可用與應用reload的三時刻。","differenceEn":"Prepare descriptors for a valid leaf, two URI SANs, an enabled CA flag and a wrong trust domain, without generating real keys. Plot old expiry, new availability and application reload.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["SRE討論共同相依與連鎖失效；本課只做邏輯失效枚舉，不假設故障互相獨立，也不把情境通過比例當成實際SLA。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 D代表共用解析、Z1與Z2代表兩區；三個單點故障情境分別只關閉D、Z1、Z2，其餘皆正常。 失D即失效，單失Z1或Z2仍可用，通過2/3=66.666667%；最小割集為{D}與{Z1,Z2}。","完成標準鏈結驗證仍不代表SVID專屬檢查通過；時間餘裕只衡量已驗證的新憑證能否在舊證到期前被應用採用。 舊證在t=900秒到期，新證t=620可用，驗證與reload共需70秒；延遲案例把新證可用時間改成760秒。 餘裕900−620−70=210秒；延遲後900−760−70=70秒。格式不合格時兩個正餘裕都不能當作允許理由。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SRE discusses shared dependencies and cascading failure. This exercise enumerates logical failure scenarios without assuming independent probabilities or interpreting the fraction of passing scenarios as a real service-level guarantee. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. D is the shared resolver and Z1/Z2 are regions. Three single-failure scenarios independently disable D, Z1 or Z2 while all other components remain available. D failure disables the service, while either individual region failure is tolerated, passing 2/3=66.666667%. Minimal cut sets are {D} and {Z1,Z2}.","Passing ordinary certificate-path validation does not imply the SVID-specific checks pass. Timing margin measures whether an already validated replacement can be adopted before the old credential expires. The old credential expires at t=900 seconds; its replacement is available at 620 and validation plus reload takes 70 seconds. A delayed fixture changes replacement availability to 760. Margin is 900−620−70=210 seconds, falling to 70 with delayed availability. Neither positive margin authorizes a replacement that fails identity or leaf-format validation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-7409e2acd490446b","url":"https://sre.google/sre-book/managing-incidents/","title":"Google SRE Book: managing incidents","titleEn":"Google SRE Book: managing incidents","publisher":"Google","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-0ece97d2d1781067","url":"https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/x509-svid/","title":"SPIFFE X509-SVID specification","titleEn":"SPIFFE X509-SVID specification","publisher":"SPIFFE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
